    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d629">

                <pb facs="0770" n="674" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg674"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. King to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bankok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-08-09"><hi rendition="#italic">August 9,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 45.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In the event of the Department being
                    interviewed by outside parties on the inclosed case, I have honor to request
                    that the Kellett assault case be permitted to stand just where it is for the
                    present, as, in my judgment, this will be for the best interests of the
                    Government.</p>
                <p>So far as I know our relations here are most cordial, and I expect them to so
                    remain.</p>
                <p>I have the honor, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hamilton King.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d629-a1.xml" xpointer="d629-a1"/>
